  {
   "type": "text",
   "text": "Hey i'm kinda new to writing rpf and i wanted to write Scar, but i'm that confident in being able to write him. \n\nI did learn that you made a really comprehensive post about Scar wit pics, could you do an updated version of the post or if you could just make a post with the pics for reference for other writers?"
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "text": "It'd be really cool and be a massive help, i'm still trying to learn and having a central reference would be great."
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "text": "hello hello anon!! ty for the kick in the butt i needed to actually get up the reconstruction of that very post i've had planned for nearly a year :D "
  },
